OL,3,GNEWSASchool uniform swap shop 'saves
OL,4,Amoney and tackles second hand clothes
OL,5,Astigma'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who set up a uniform swap shop at
OL,8,Fhis children's primary four years ago
OL,9,Fnow has more than 200 schools involved.
OL,11,FJon from Cardiff came up with the idea
OL,12,Fas a result of the cost-of-living
OL,13,Fcrisis, to help parents with the
OL,14,Ffinancial burden of paying for a
OL,15,Funiform which can run into hundreds of
OL,16,Fpounds.
OL,18,FFrom a plastic collection box outside
OL,19,FJon's house, the Free School clothes
OL,20,Fscheme has now launched a website and
OL,21,F8,000 items have been exchanged.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
